  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Performance: Design and Production Core Elective Table I and II"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "For students admitted Fall 2025 and after: Students must choose 12 core electives from Table I and II. Students may take up to two courses offered by the Creative School and approved by the Director of the Performance: Design and Production program. Design and Production students must take a minimum of two (2) courses from Table I."
    },
